 "packToMarkdown": "# Work, Energy and Power\n\n## Concept notes\n\n### Collisions\n\n- Momentum conserved\n- KE conserved only in elastic\n\nSee derivation in reader.\n\n### Work–energy theorem\n\n- W = ΔKE\n\n## Formulas\n\n- v = u + at\n- F = ma\n- P = W/t\n- F = ma\n\n## Past questions\n\n### NEB 2080\n\n1. A ball drops from 5 m. Find v at impact. [2]\n   - Answer: v = √(2gh) = 10 m/s.\n2. Define power. [1]\n   - Answer: Rate of doing work.\n\n### NEB 2079\n\n1. Show W = F·d for constant force. [2]\n\n## Concept drills\n\n1. Does friction always oppose motion?\n   - Answer: It opposes relative sliding.\n",
